        "rerank_score": 0.0982,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7024. Requests to Know.\n\u00a7 7024. Requests to Know.\n\n(a)\nFor requests that seek the disclosure of specific pieces of information about\nthe consumer, if a business cannot verify the..."
      }
