        "rerank_score": 0.0043,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7025. Opt-out Preference Signals.\n(b):\n(1)\nThe business shall treat the opt-out preference signal as a valid request\nto opt-out of sale/sharing submitted pursuant to Civil Code s..."
      }
