    "generated_answer": "To be qualified to complete and submit the cybersecurity audit **Certification of Completion**, a member of the business\u2019s executive management team must meet the following criteria as set forth in **\u00a7 7124(c)**:\n\n*   **Responsibility:** The individual must be directly responsible for the business\u2019s cybersecurity-audit compliance.\n*   **Knowledge:** The individual must have sufficient knowledge of the business\u2019s cybersecurity audit to provide accurate information.\n*   **Authority:** The individual must have the authority to submit the business\u2019s certification to the Agency.\n\nAdditionally, the certification submitted by this individual must include an electronically signed attestation under penalty of perjury confirming they meet these requirements and that the business has not attempted to influence the auditor\u2019s decisions or assessments (**\u00a7 7124(d)(4)**).",
