        "rerank_score": 0.2682,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7152. Risk Assessment Requirements.\n\u00a7 7152. Risk Assessment Requirements.\n\n(a)\nA business must conduct a risk assessment to determine whether the risks to\nconsumers\u2019 privacy from..."
