    "ground_truth_answer": "Under \u00a7 7123(c)(5)(C), secure configuration assessment includes verifying that sensitive personal information (as defined in Civil Code \u00a7 1798.145(ae)(1)(A)\u2013(B)) and other personal data as appropriate is masked by default in applications by systematically removing or replacing it with symbols such as asterisks or bullets.",
