        "rerank_score": 0.9877,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7010. Overview of Required Disclosures.\n(a) Every business that must comply with the CCPA and these regulations shall\nprovide a privacy policy in accordance with the CCPA and sec..."
      },
      {
