        "rerank_score": 0.9085,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7025. Opt-out Preference Signals.\n\u00a7 7025. Opt-out Preference Signals.\n\n(a)\nThe purpose of an opt-out preference signal is to provide consumers with a\nsimple and easy-to-use metho..."
      },
      {
        "parent_id": "v2026_sec7026_p2",
        "section": "7026",
