    "generated_answer": "Based on the statutory comparative context provided, here is the analysis regarding the frequency of risk assessment updates:\n\n**Analysis of Statutory Evolution**\nThe provided text contains only the definition of \"CCPA\" (which moved from \u00a7 7001(g) in 2023 to \u00a7 7001(h) in 2026). The wording of this definition remains unchanged.\n\n**Response to Your Question**\nThe provided statutory context **does not contain any provisions** regarding the frequency of risk assessments or the requirements for updating them in the absence of material changes. \n\nBecause the provided text is limited strictly to the definition of \"CCPA,\" there is no information available within this specific comparative context to answer your question regarding the frequency of review or update requirements for risk assessments.",
