        "rerank_score": 0.1115,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7004. Requirements for Methods for Submitting CCPA Requests and Obtaining\n(b) A method that does not comply with subsection (a) may be a dark\npattern. The illustrative examples p..."
      },
