        "rerank_score": 0.0158,
        "snippet": "\u00a7 7222. Requests to Access ADMT.\n\u00a7 7222. Requests to Access ADMT.\n\n(a)\nA business that uses ADMT to make a significant decision must provide a\nconsumer with information about this ..."
      }
