    "llm_judge_reasoning": "The candidate answer is legally precise, fully aligned with the ground truth, and correctly identifies the regulatory consequences under the CCPA. It accurately cites the relevant sections (\u00a7 7050(e)) and explains the chain of legal consequences (loss of status leading to classification as sale/sharing, which triggers opt-out requirements). The candidate also appropriately notes the limitation regarding the text of \u00a7 7051, demonstrating high transparency.",
